    "id": "satou-korokke",
    "category": "shop",
    "name": {
     "en": "Satō Korokke",
     "ja": "さとうコロッケ店"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "Frying croquettes since 1948, when it sold them in the black market by the station. Regulars kept it going when the market closed. It's down a lane off Kyōkai-dōri, with a queue at lunchtime.",
     "ja": "1948年創業。闇市時代から駅前でコロッケを揚げていた店で、闇市がなくなっても常連の声で続いた。教会通りの路地の奥にあり、昼は行列ができる。"
    },
